---
<section class="hero" id="top">
  <div class="wrap hero-center">
    <div class="badges" data-reveal>
      <span class="badge coral">Open Source</span>
      <span class="badge teal">Laravel 12</span>
      <span class="badge gold">AGPL-3.0</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="hero-title" data-words>Built by a <em>community</em> of makers, for makers.</h1>
    <p class="hero-deck" data-reveal>Koamishin is a developer collective crafting secure, high-performance Laravel applications and open-source packages — from starter kits to full business systems, built in the open and free to fork.</p>
    <div class="hero-ctas" data-reveal>
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="#projects">Explore the Projects →</a>
      <a class="btn btn-ghost" href="#join">Join the Community</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-proof" data-reveal>
      <div class="avatars" aria-hidden="true">
        <img src="/team/yukazakiri.png" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/team/SorenOutis.png" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/team/Jaymark.png" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/team/Rui-Zen.png" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" />
        <img src="/team/Angelika.png" alt="" width="34" height="34" loading="lazy" />
      </div>
      <p><b>5-member collective</b> · <b>12+ packages</b> · <b>150k+ downloads</b></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
